  "description": "A direct disclosure-group hit, with a terminating quotient. The account's ACCT-GROUP-ID is A000000000 and discgrp.txt row 2 - verbatim, A000000000 type 01 category 0003 at twenty-five percent - is present, so the READ at :416 reports '00', the '23' window at :436-439 is never entered, and NEITHER of the :418-419 lines is displayed. That absence is the assertion: case10 seeds the same shape without the matching group and gets two extra lines, so the pair isolates the fallback from everything else. 1200.00 at twenty-five percent is 25.00 exactly - a terminating quotient, chosen so this case proves the store keeps a result it should keep rather than truncating something it should not.",
